<title>USA: Sage Laboratories Inc year share rises.</title>
<headline>Sage Laboratories Inc year share rises.</headline>
<dateline>NATICK, Mass. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			   1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.38		    $1.20</p>
<p> Net			  1,609		    1,389</p>
<p> Revs			 9,769		    9,154</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Fiscal year period ended June 30.  </p>
<p>NOTE: Net income reflected a $256,000 or $0.22 per share, pre-tax loss on sales of $375,000 from Sage Laboratories Active Microwave Inc. This compares to a pre-tax loss of $458,000 or $0.40  per share on sales of $117,000 for the same period a year ago.</p>
</text>
